Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie, you gotta give her a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already thought of the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She will be called...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Norn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed! Everyone...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Al, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:01:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, I thought I heard Sophie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip, you know that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed! Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,ED! AL! WINRY!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,THANK YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I heard Sophie, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,, All right already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably just one of the machines...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So-Sophie...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,SOPHIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Winry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Norn...?
